mstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1127660/extras/224598f849d32c300ea42e94dc0bb835.webm?t=1729436252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1127660/extras/224598f849d32c300ea42e94dc0bb835.mp4?t=1729436252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>4: Drown<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1127660/extras/668b4598acd145830d35fd2b4ad4df3f.poster.avif?t=1729436252\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1127660/extras/668b4598acd145830d35fd2b4ad4df3f.webm?t=1729436252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1127660/extras/668b4598acd145830d35fd2b4ad4df3f.mp4?t=1729436252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>With old-school platforming mechanics, more than 50 exciting levels, and a full original soundtrack, you'll be entertained for hours. But watch out - you'll have to navigate around enemies, spikes, perform death-defying jumps, and hold your breath for longer than you might be comfortable with.  Make friends along the way, and see if you have what it takes to conquer Mask Quest!<br><br>Fully translated into English, German, French, Chinese, Greek, Latin, and Toki Pona. <br><br>Don't miss out on the fun - add it to your wishlist today and be the first to play when it releases in 2024!",
